      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] There are a few issues with `test_accelgyro_config_fifo_power_off`:\n\n1. **Missing active pre-state check**: Calling `set_data_rate(acc, 0, 0)` directly without first setting a non-zero ODR and verifying that `LSM6DSO_FIFO_CTRL3_ADDR` has non-zero FIFO ODR bits means the test will pass trivially if `LSM6DSO_FIFO_CTRL3_ADDR` already contains `0` (and `st_write_data_with_mask()` skips the I2C write completely when `new_data \u003d\u003d old_data`).\n2. **Missing gyroscope mask coverage**: `LSM6DSO_FIFO_ODR_MASK(s)` branches on `s-\u003etype \u003d\u003d MOTIONSENSE_TYPE_ACCEL ? LSM6DSO_FIFO_ODR_XL_MASK : LSM6DSO_FIFO_ODR_G_MASK`. Exercising both `acc` and `gyr` verifies both branches and confirms that powering off one sensor only clears its own FIFO ODR bits without clobbering the other sensor\u0027s FIFO ODR bits.\n3. **Named constant**: Use `LSM6DSO_DIS_BIT` instead of literal `0` when asserting the disabled register field value.\n\nSuggested update:\n\n```c\nZTEST(lsm6dso, test_accelgyro_config_fifo_power_off)\n{\n\tconst struct emul *emul \u003d EMUL_DT_GET(LSM6DSO_NODE);\n\tstruct motion_sensor_t *acc \u003d \u0026motion_sensors[ACC_SENSOR_ID];\n\tstruct motion_sensor_t *gyr \u003d \u0026motion_sensors[GYR_SENSOR_ID];\n\tuint8_t ctrl3;\n\tint rv;\n\n\t/* Configure both sensors to an active ODR first. */\n\trv \u003d acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_data_rate(acc, LSM6DSO_ODR_MIN_VAL, 0);\n\tzassert_equal(rv, EC_SUCCESS);\n\trv \u003d gyr-\u003edrv-\u003eset_data_rate(gyr, LSM6DSO_ODR_MIN_VAL, 0);\n\tzassert_equal(rv, EC_SUCCESS);\n\n\trv \u003d i2c_common_emul_read_byte(emul, LSM6DSO_FIFO_CTRL3_ADDR, \u0026ctrl3);\n\tzassert_equal(rv, 0);\n\tzassert_not_equal(ctrl3 \u0026 LSM6DSO_FIFO_ODR_MASK(acc), LSM6DSO_DIS_BIT);\n\tzassert_not_equal(ctrl3 \u0026 LSM6DSO_FIFO_ODR_MASK(gyr), LSM6DSO_DIS_BIT);\n\n\t/* Power off accel: accel FIFO ODR is cleared, gyro FIFO ODR remains set. */\n\trv \u003d acc-\u003edrv-\u003eset_data_rate(acc, 0, 0);\n\tzassert_equal(rv, EC_SUCCESS);\n\n\trv \u003d i2c_common_emul_read_byte(emul, LSM6DSO_FIFO_CTRL3_ADDR, \u0026ctrl3);\n\tzassert_equal(rv, 0);\n\tzassert_equal(ctrl3 \u0026 LSM6DSO_FIFO_ODR_MASK(acc), LSM6DSO_DIS_BIT);\n\tzassert_not_equal(ctrl3 \u0026 LSM6DSO_FIFO_ODR_MASK(gyr), LSM6DSO_DIS_BIT);\n\n\t/* Power off gyro: gyro FIFO ODR is also cleared. */\n\trv \u003d gyr-\u003edrv-\u003eset_data_rate(gyr, 0, 0);\n\tzassert_equal(rv, EC_SUCCESS);\n\n\trv \u003d i2c_common_emul_read_byte(emul, LSM6DSO_FIFO_CTRL3_ADDR, \u0026ctrl3);\n\tzassert_equal(rv, 0);\n\tzassert_equal(ctrl3 \u0026 LSM6DSO_FIFO_ODR_MASK(gyr), LSM6DSO_DIS_BIT);\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/692e539d-70a2-4e12-81e8-26af5690dda6)",
